  "notes": "Labels: IOxx (RP2040 GPIO column) used where printed; for the A0-A3 rows the GPIO-colour column prints ADC0-ADC3, so the board name A0-A3 is the label with ADCn as a function. Board silkscreen spellings (RST, 3V, ARf, En, 13, SCK, SDO...) listed first in functions when different. Legend: '* = Digital I/O, not Analog inputs on this board' (A4*, A5*). Image 2 is a lower-resolution copy of the same artwork. Skipped USB-C, battery JST, RST/BOOT buttons, CHG/L LEDs and the ANT U.FL connector."
